    "detailed_description": "Every character has a tempo that must be matched, but you must choose the correct attack. Choosing incorrectly can result in a penalty.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn order to destroy a target, you must not miss a beat. Missing a beat or choosing the wrong attack resets the enemies health gauge. Fill the health gauge to destroy the enemy.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game has 15 rounds starting with a pre-tutorial round. There are various enemy types and each round has a unique combination that you must learn to overcome.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThere is also a dash movement ability that makes the game fast paced. Use this to avoid enemy attacks, or use it to close the distance so that you can land a melee beat.",
    "about_the_game": "Every character has a tempo that must be matched, but you must choose the correct attack. Choosing incorrectly can result in a penalty.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn order to destroy a target, you must not miss a beat. Missing a beat or choosing the wrong attack resets the enemies health gauge. Fill the health gauge to destroy the enemy.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game has 15 rounds starting with a pre-tutorial round. There are various enemy types and each round has a unique combination that you must learn to overcome.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThere is also a dash movement ability that makes the game fast paced. Use this to avoid enemy attacks, or use it to close the distance so that you can land a melee beat.",
